              "@id": "urn:uuid:0adf4d11-ddc8-5721-8a08-8dfc21413eb1",
              "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedString",
              "uco-observable:stringValue": "Case 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 1 of 7\n\nU.S.\nIN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT\n\nFOR THE DISTRICT OF WYOMING\n\nUNITED STATES OF AMERICA,\nNo.\nPlaintiff,\nCt. 1: 18 U.S.C. \u00a7\u00a7 2252A(a)(2)(A) and\nv. (b)(1)\n(Distribution of Child\nKYLE BRADLEY SMITH, Pornography)\n\nDefendant. Ct.2: 18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2251(a), (e)\n(Sexual Exploitation of Children)\n\nCt.3: 18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2422(b)\n(Attempting to Entice Minor to\nEngage in Illegal Sexual Activity)\n\nCts. 4-5:\n18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2251(a), (e)\n(Attempted Sexual Exploitation of\nChildren)\n\nCt.6: 18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2260A\n(Commission of a Felony Sex\nOffense by an Individual\nRequired to Register as a Sex\nOffender)\n\nREDACTED - Minor Victim\n**\nNOTICE OF FORFEITURE**\n\nINDICTMENT\n\nTHE GRAND JURY CHARGES THAT:\n\nCOUNT ONE\n\nBeginning on or about February 5, 2022, through on or about April 13, 2022, in the District\n\nof Wyoming, the Defendant, KYLE BRADLEY SMITH, knowingly distributed child\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 2 of 7\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 3 of 7\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 4 of 7\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 5 of 7\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 6 of 7\nCase 1:22-cr-00137-ABJ Document 1 Filed 11/17/22 Page 7 of 7"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
